Vallado's reference SGP4 propagator (C++)
=========================================

SGP4.h and SGP4.cpp in this directory are David Vallado's reference implementation of
SGP4, vendored unmodified: byte for byte as distributed, CRLF line endings included
(.gitattributes keeps Git from converting them). Do not edit them. Huira includes them
through include/huira_impl/third_party/sgp4.ipp.

Source      AIAA-2006-6753.zip, directory cpp/SGP4/SGP4/
            https://celestrak.org/publications/AIAA/2006-6753/AIAA-2006-6753.zip
Main page   https://celestrak.org/publications/AIAA/2006-6753/
Revision    2023 May 09 (the main page was last updated 2023 May 10). SGP4.h in this
            revision still defines SGP4Version as "SGP4 Version 2020-07-13".
Copied via  python-sgp4 (https://github.com/brandon-rhodes/python-sgp4), commit fac882a
            ("Update C++ code to Vallado revision of 2023 May 09"), which copies the
            zip's files verbatim, into its extension/ directory.
