Updating
--------
Take updates only from AIAA-2006-6753.zip. Do not take SGP4 from
https://github.com/CelesTrak/fundamentals-of-astrodynamics: that repository, though also
Vallado's, is licensed under the GNU AGPL-3.0, which Huira's MIT license cannot carry.
When updating, copy SGP4.h and SGP4.cpp from the zip unchanged, update the revision and
SHA-256 sums above, and run test_sgp4 (tests/unittests/third_party/).
